  "slug": "baked-peaches-with-ricotta-and-amaretti",
  "title": "Baked Peaches with Ricotta and Amaretti",
  "blurb": "Halved peaches filled with sweetened ricotta, topped with crumbled amaretti biscuits and a nugget of marzipan, then baked until soft and golden.",
  "steps": [
    "Heat your oven to 200°C.",
    "Halve the peaches and remove the stones, then arrange them cut side up in a baking dish.",
    "Mix the ricotta with the sugar in a small bowl.",
    "Spoon the ricotta mixture into the hollow of each peach half.",
    "Break the marzipan into small pieces and press one piece into the ricotta on each peach.",
    "Crush the amaretti biscuits lightly and scatter them over the peaches along with the flaked almonds.",
    "Bake for 5 minutes until the peaches are softened and the topping is lightly golden."
  ],
